{"line":"T34.C.02","text":"Was die Verankerung angeht, ist „eigennützig“ fair. Es ist ein Kriterium, das zufällig genau das ausschließt, worauf es zielt. Und es bröckelt: Modelle sehen inzwischen Bilder, benutzen Werkzeuge und handeln in Umgebungen. Außerdem kam vieles von deinem eigenen Verständnis von „Gerechtigkeit“ oder „Primzahl“ über Wörter, nicht über die Sinne.","lufs":-19.06,"alignment":{"characters":["W","a","s"," ","d","i","e"," ","V","e","r","a","n","k","e","r","u","n","g"," ","a","n","g","e","h","t",","," ","i","s","t"," ","„","e","i","g","e","n","n","ü","t","z","i","g","“"," ","f","a","i","r","."," ","E","s"," ","i","s","t"," ","e","i","n"," ","K","r","i","t","e","r","i","u","m",","," ","d","a","s"," ","z","u","f","ä","l","l","i","g"," ","g","e","n","a","u"," ","d","a","s"," ","a","u","s","s","c","h","l","i","e","ß","t",","," ","w","o","r","a","u","f"," ","e","s"," ","z","i","e","l","t","."," ","U","n","d"," ","e","s"," ","b","r","ö","c","k","e","l","t",":"," ","M","o","d","e","l","l","e"," ","s","e","h","e","n"," ","i","n","z","w","i","s","c","h","e","n"," ","B","i","l","d","e","r",","," ","b","e","n","u","t","z","e","n"," ","W","e","r","k","z","e","u","g","e"," ","u","n","d"," ","h","a","n","d","e","l","n"," ","i","n"," ","U","m","g","e","b","u","n","g","e","n","."," ","A","u","ß","e","r","d","e","m"," ","k","a","m"," ","v","i","e","l","e","s"," ","v","o","n"," ","d","e","i","n","e","m"," ","e","i","g","e","n","e","n"," ","V","e","r","s","t","ä","n","d","n","i","s"," ","v","o","n"," ","„","G","e","r","e","c","h","t","i","g","k","e","i","t","“"," ","o","d","e","r"," ","„","P","r","i","m","z","a","h","l","“"," ","ü","b","e","r"," ","W","ö","r","t","e","r",","," ","n","i","c","h","t"," ","ü","b","e","r"," ","d","i","e"," ","S","i","n","n","e","."],"character_start_times_seconds":[0,0.053,0.107,0.16,0.2,0.24,0.28,0.32,0.36,0.4,0.44,0.48,0.544,0.608,0.672,0.736,0.8,0.827,0.853,0.88,0.944,1.008,1.072,1.136,1.2,1.28,1.36,1.44,1.5,1.56,1.62,1.68,1.8,1.92,2,2